      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "需留意",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "you don't really keep anything between expeditions. Every run feels like starting over",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199191644791/recommended/2569760/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "拾取财宝时的强制动画无法关闭",
